#Data Arrangement:
#For the 4x4 tables, each starting pair needs its own table.
#This is the AA table:  
#			5' --> 3'      
#			    AX
#			    UY
#			3' <-- 5'   
#			    Y->          
#	   	---------------------------- 
#	(X) 	A	C	G	U  
#	 | 	----------------------------
#	 V   
#	(A) 	-0.2	5.7	0.2	5.7
#	(C) 	1.4	9.7	1.4	3.4
#	(G) 	-5.2	5.7	0.2	5.7
#	(U) 	1.4	8.3	1.4	-3.8

#An energy of "." is "infinity," i.e. not allowed.


#		5' --> 3'
		   AX
		   UY
#		3' <-- 5'
#		    Y 
# 	---------------------------- 
	A	C	G	U    
# 	----------------------------  
A	-3.9	2.0	-3.5	2.0
C	-2.3	6.0	-2.3	-0.3
G	-8.9	2.0	-3.5	2.0
U	-2.3	4.6	-2.3	-7.5



#		5' --> 3'
		   CX
		   GY
#		3' <-- 5'
#		    Y 
# 	---------------------------- 
	A	C	G	U    
# 	----------------------------  
A	-9.1	-5.6	-5.6	-5.6
C	-5.7	-3.4	-5.7	-2.7
G	-14	5.6	-9.2	-5.6
U	-5.7	-5.3	-5.7	-14.4


#		5' --> 3'
		   GX
		   CY
#		3' <-- 5'
#		    Y 
# 	---------------------------- 
	A	C	G	U    
# 	----------------------------  
A	-5.2	-4.0	-5.6	-4.0
C	-7.2	0.5	-7.2	-4.2
G	-12.9	-4.0	-6.2	-4.0
U	-7.2	-0.3	-7.2	-10.8


#		5' --> 3'
		   GX
		   UY
#		3' <-- 5'
#		    Y 
# 	---------------------------- 
	A	C	G	U    
# 	----------------------------  
A	-3.4	2.0	-3.5	2.0
C	-2.3	6.0	-2.3	-0.3
G	-6.4	2.0	-3.5	2.0
U	-2.3	4.6	-2.3	-4.2



#		5' --> 3'
		   UX
		   AY
#		3' <-- 5'
#		    Y 
# 	---------------------------- 
	A	C	G	U    
# 	----------------------------  
A	-4.0	-6.3	-8.9	-6.3
C	-4.3	-5.1	-4.3	-1.8
G	-9.6	-6.3	-8.9	-6.3
U	-4.3	-1.4	-4.3	-4.4


